---
// Same code, same settings (500 days of noise, 1,000 passes, cost 0.05%), ten different training histories (seeds 1-10).
// For each: return on its own training path and mean over the same 100 fresh paths. Output of seeds.py, recorded in the post notes.
const W = 900;
const H = 372;
const d = [
  [1, 8.9, -2.5, 50], [2, 15.3, -9.0, 167], [3, 0, 0, 0], [4, 16.5, -7.6, 159], [5, 0, 0, 0],
  [6, 5.4, -6.4, 150], [7, 0, 0, 0], [8, 10.1, -2.4, 70], [9, 18.8, -0.9, 32], [10, 25.2, -8.3, 169],
];
const X0 = 150, STEP = 72, Z = 190, K = 5.2;
---
<figure class="p19-sd">
  <div class="p19-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Ten training runs of the same agent with different random training histories. Seven earn between 5.4 and 25.2 percent on their own training path, and every one of those seven loses on fresh paths, between 0.9 and 9.0 percent. Three learn to stay flat and trade zero times.">
      <text x="30" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Same code, ten training histories, ten different agents</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một code, mười lịch sử huấn luyện, mười agent khác nhau</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="60" x2="850" y1={Z} y2={Z} class="zero" />
      {d.map(([s, a, b, tr], i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={X0 + i * STEP - 22} y={Z - a * K} width="20" height={Math.max(a * K, 0)} class="a" />
          <rect x={X0 + i * STEP + 2} y={Z} width="20" height={Math.max(-b * K, 0)} class="b" />
          <text x={X0 + i * STEP} y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="s">{s}</text>
          <text x={X0 + i * STEP} y="318" text-anchor="middle" class="s">{tr === 0 ? '0' : tr}</text>
          {tr === 0 && (
            <text x={X0 + i * STEP} y={Z - 12} text-anchor="middle" class="s">
              <tspan data-lang-en>flat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đứng ngoài</tspan>
            </text>
          )}
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="30" y="300" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>seed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>seed</tspan></text>
      <text x="30" y="318" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>trades</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lệnh đổi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="60" y="46" width="14" height="14" class="a" />
      <text x="82" y="58" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>on its own training path (%, up)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trên chuỗi đã học (%, hướng lên)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="60" y="68" width="14" height="14" class="b" />
      <text x="82" y="80" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>mean of 100 fresh paths (%, down)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trung bình 100 chuỗi mới (%, hướng xuống)</tspan></text>
      <text x="30" y="352" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Report the best seed and you report +25.2% in-sample. Report all ten and you see 7 losers on new data and 3 agents that quit.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ báo seed tốt nhất thì bạn báo +25,2% trong mẫu. Báo cả mười thì thấy 7 agent lỗ trên dữ liệu mới và 3 agent bỏ cuộc.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Henderson and colleagues saw the same spread in standard benchmarks: two groups of five seeds, same settings, gave learning curves that differ significantly (t = −9.09, p = 0.0016).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Henderson và cộng sự thấy cùng độ lệch này trên các bài benchmark chuẩn: hai nhóm năm seed, cùng thiết lập, cho đường học khác nhau có ý nghĩa thống kê (t = −9,09, p = 0,0016).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p19-sd { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p19-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p19-sd svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p19-sd text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p19-sd .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-sd .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-sd .s2 { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-sd .zero { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p19-sd .a { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p19-sd .b { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p19-sd figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
